 "description": "<p>The upgrade in this generation is mechanical: an interior wiggle mechanism that makes the rose head flex in a tongue-like motion rather than simply buzzing, plus two independent thrust-and-vibration motors in the insertable end. The result reads as two coordinated toys — a flicking external head and an active internal shaft.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator rose\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorrose_4_96f36c81-7f51-46eb-b19a-957ad7d32612_480x480.jpg?v=1692588029\"></p>\n<p>Four functions, ten modes each — the 4 x 10 grid the listing advertises — and the grid is honest: every function counts to ten independently. The build is unisex by design, aimed at clitoral and nipple stimulation on one side and prostate arousal and erection assistance on the other.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator rose\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorrose_3_5027178d-bf5d-48e0-a57d-3731d0aabc8e_480x480.jpg?v=1692588024\"></p>\n<p>Skin-friendly silicone covers both ends, IPX7 sealing allows full submersion, and a full charge returns about 45 minutes of the dual-motor load. For couples covering both sides of the grid, one toy carries the whole session.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorrose_5_88718710-935c-4587-8d85-6d527a139138_480x480.jpg?v=1692588034\" alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator rose\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Functions: wiggling rose head + thrusting/vibrating insertable (4 x 10 modes)</li>\n<li>Use: unisex — clitoral, nipple, prostate</li>\n<li>Material: skin-friendly silicone</li>\n<li>Battery: USB, ~45 min runtime</li>\n<li>Waterproof: IPX7</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator rose\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorrose_2_4b30751d-da19-4514-b2d3-2ad24b23c840_480x480.jpg?v=1692588018\"></p>\n<p>Forty settings across a two-body design — the couples' rose with the mechanism to match.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Dual-ended rose with wiggling head and dual thrust motors, 4&#215;10 modes, unisex use and IPX7 silicone; about 45 minutes per charge.</p>\n",
